		"description": "<p>(1/turn) Whenever you attack with a firearm, all Rifle Turrets in range of the target fire as well. Rifle Turret attacks hit if your attack hits, crit if your attack crits, or miss if your attack misses.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Your first firearm attack each turn (Pistol, Rifle, Blunderbuss, Hidden Pistol): every Rifle Turret of yours within Range 12 of the target fires at it for free with your result — a miss for all on a miss, a crit (maximum primary die) on a crit, a hit otherwise. Spends the 1/turn counter on this feature (refills at the start of your turn; click it to correct mistakes) with an Undo card.</em></p>",
